    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub centers on the operationalization of [decision capture as a core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), initially framed in March 2026 as the primary mechanism for artifact generation at the moment of consensus. By July 2026, the discussion shifted toward the concrete delivery of this vision, specifically through the [Sprint 4 delivery account](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryAccount). Recent updates from the team highlight the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_1) as a milestone, attributing the [highest quarterly velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_2) to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_3). The current span moves from the high-level strategic intent of capturing consensus to the technical and velocity-based evidence of that feature's implementation.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_Sprint4DeliveryAccount> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "decision capture at the point of consensus" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tension exists between the abstract goal of consensus-capture and the specific technical dependency on the Zephyr integration." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784715317938_3> ] ;
